{"id":"schrei","lemma":"Schrei","pos":"noun","rank":1766,"glosses":["shout, cry, scream","cry","craze"],"ipa":"/ʃʁaɪ̯/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d4/De-Schrei.ogg/De-Schrei.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Schreies","plural":"Schreie"},"examples":[{"text":"Er hörte einen Schrei.","en":"He heard a shout.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/32751","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null]},{"text":"Hast du einen Schrei gehört?","en":"Did you hear a scream?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"}]},{"text":"Habt ihr keinen Schrei gehört?","en":"Didn't you hear a scream?","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null,{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"}]},{"text":"Schrei mich bitte nicht an!","en":"Please don't scream at me.","words":[null,{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"please"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"at / on"}]},{"text":"Ich dachte, ich hätte einen Schrei gehört.","en":"I thought I heard a scream.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"denken"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"}]}]}